cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Recueil in your work, please cite it as below.
title: Recueil
abstract: >-
  Recueil is a self-hosted server that gathers documents from anywhere
  (browser, mail, scanner, WebDAV, camera), keeps a content-addressed library
  with a bibliographic facet, verifies and enriches references against the open
  scholarly graph, and exposes the whole library to R, Python and LLMs as data.
  Systematic reviews and bibliometric mapping are native workflows, not
  exports.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Heller
    given-names: Raban
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-08-22'
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/etabli-dev/etabli-recueil
keywords:
  - reference manager
  - document management
  - bibliometrics
  - systematic review
  - citation verification
  - self-hosted
  - research software

